    <bpmn:process id="W_W3084" name="W3084. Kit/Bundle Sell-Through, Attachment &amp; Cannibalization Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly/monthly performance review
Frequency: Weekly + monthly
Volume: Active kit/bundle portfolio
Owner: Merchandising Analytics Manager
Participants: Merchandising Analytics, Merchandising, Pricing, Marketing
Source: workflow W3084 — Kit/Bundle Sell-Through, Attachment &amp; Cannibalization Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3084_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3084_Lane1" name="Merchandising Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3084_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3084_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3084_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3084_Lane2" name="Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3084_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3084_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3084_Start4" name="Weekly/monthly performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3084_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3084_Task5" name="Merchandising Analytics produce kit/bundle sell-through: units, revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising Analytics produce kit/bundle sell-through: units, revenue, sell-through rate, attach rate (bundle vs. component standalone), by channel
Responsible (R): Merchandising Analytics
Accountable (A): Merchandising Analytics Manager
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3084_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3084_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3084_Task6" name="Merchandising Analytics assess cannibalization: bundle sales displacing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandising Analytics assess cannibalization: bundle sales displacing component standalone sales; net incremental revenue/margin
Responsible (R): Merchandising Analytics
Accountable (A): Merchandising Analytics Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3084_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3084_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3084_Task7" name="Merchandising/Pricing act on findings (expand/cut bundles, adjust pricing)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandising/Pricing act on findings (expand/cut bundles, adjust pricing); feed decisions to portfolio review (W3088)
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Pricing
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
